# STM32 LED Blinking Project

## Overview
LED blinking project using STM32 Nucleo-C031C6.

## Hardware
- STM32 Nucleo-C031C6
- Red LED
- 220 Ohm Resistor

## Software
- VS Code
- PlatformIO
- STM32 HAL
- Wokwi Simulator

## GPIO Configuration
- PA5 - LED Output
- GND - LED Cathode

## Working
LED turns ON for 1 second and OFF for 1 second.

## Concepts Learned
- STM32 GPIO
- GPIO Output Mode
- STM32 HAL Library
- Delay Function
- Embedded C Programming

## Simulation
Wokwi simulation included in this repository.

